        "TileImage": "$($repository b395fabb-c557-414c-a315-661e1722b1ee).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of Rima Shah, the trusted advisor of Vanya Shah. Despite not being related, Yanya gave her her surname as an award, due to Rima saving Vanyas life during a pirate raid. Rima took a bullet for her, crippling her own body. She also is the food taster of Vanya.\rAfter those events, Rima quickly became Vanyas most trusted advisor and confidant. \rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
